May Challenge - Flowers.\n\nOh my...swooning is usually reserved for butterfly cards, but in the case of this stunning beauty you've created, it's happening right. now! Gorgeous hydrangea, marvelous use of vellum (which I love on other people's cards!) and the oh-so-pretty whisper of embossing. LOVE this!Hugs~c\n\nDang girl! Had to pop over to Loll's and see the technique. Your flower and leaves are amazing, and they do have so much dimension!! Absolutely gorgeous card. Might have to try this one of these days. Love it! Bev","tokens":["Pages","\n\n","Wednesday",","," May"," ","2","0",","," ","2","0","1","5","\n\n","CAS","(E",")"," This"," Sketch"," #","1","2","3","\n\n","Som","etime"," sketch"," challenges"," can"," be"," difficult"," but"," this"," one"," from"," CAS","(E",")"," This"," Sketch"," is"," a"," great"," one",".\n\n","There"," is"," so"," much"," inspiration"," from"," the"," design"," team"," and"," those"," that"," have"," already"," posted"," to"," the"," gallery","."," Why"," not"," go"," check"," them"," out","."," But"," not"," before"," you"," see"," my"," card",".\n\n","The"," flower"," from"," Winn","ie"," and"," Walter"," is"," water","col","ored"," with"," Dist","ress"," Ink","."," I"," emb","ossed"," some"," v","ell","um"," with"," a"," border"," folder",","," added"," the"," Hero"," Arts"," sentiment"," emb","ossed"," in"," silver",","," then"," put"," it"," all"," on"," Fog"," cs"," from"," S","SS","."," I"," also"," used"," a"," trick"," from"," L","oll"," from"," St","amping"," with"," L","oll"," to"," curve"," the"," images","."," You"," can"," see"," her"," video"," here","."," I"," don","'t"," have"," a"," styl","us"," big"," enough"," so"," I"," used"," the"," end"," of"," a"," paint","brush"," which"," worked"," just"," fine",","," although"," I"," will"," be"," buying"," a"," bigger"," styl","us","."," :)\n\n","Edited"," to"," add",":"," At"," the"," urging"," of"," Carol"," May","ne",","," I","'m"," also"," entering"," this"," car