ku w godzinach od 8:00 do 18:00, w soboty od 8:00 do 14:00. Dział reklamacji pracuje od poniedziałku do piątku w godz. 8:00 – 16:00. Odbiór osobisty możliwy jest w Krakowie ul. Mogilska 120 w godzinach: pn-pt: 10:00-19:00, sobota: 9:00-15:00. Sklep internetowy PRESTO prowadzi sprzedaż wysyłkową na terenie Rzeczypospolitej Polskiej i Unii Europejskiej oraz sprzedaż bezpośrednią poprzez sklepy stacjonarne. Czas dostawy przesyłki jest zgodnie z informacjami podanymi na karcie danego produktu.\nZwroty\nKonsument będzie musiał ponieść bezpośrednie koszty zwrotu Towaru. Jeśli Towar ze względu na swój charakter nie może zostać w zwykły sposób odesłany pocztą, wówczas Konsument poniesie bezpośrednie koszty zwrotu Towarów, których wysokość szacowana jest na kwotę od 12,90 zł do 128,00 zł, zależną od wagi i wymiarów zwracanych Towarów i możliwą do określania na stronie z kosztami wysyłki\nDane techniczne:\nNominalnie dedykowana do uprawiania wszelkich sportów ruchowych, takich jak bieganie, jazda na rowerze, górski trekking, czy też wspinaczka kurtka letnia Campus Dakar II. Lekka, dobrze dopasowana i oddychająca. Wszystko to sprawia, że kurtka zapewnia komfort i swobodę podczas użytkowania zarówno przy aktywności fizycznej, jak i na co dzień.\nKurtka outdoorowa Dakar wyposażona została w parę klasycznych kieszeni bocznych na zamki kryte patkami z możliwością schowania jej do jednej z nich. Wówczas kurtka przyjmuje bardzo kompaktowe i wygodne do transportu gabaryty. Reprezentuje letnią linię Light Wear polskiego lidera odzieży outdoorowej Campus. Pozwala czuć się pewnie i swobodnie zarówno na górskich szlakach, w warunkach szybkich zmian pogody, jak i na co dzień, w użytku miejskim. Membrana Vaportex™ Activ wraz z wodoodpornymi, podklejanymi szwami zapewnia wysoki poziom odporności na wodę oraz ochronę przed wiatrem. Zachowując te właściwości kurtka dobrze ,,oddycha\" transmitując ciepło i wilgoć na zewnątrz.\nVaportex™ jest materiałem membranowym o wysokich parametrach odporności na przemakanie oraz oddychalności. Odzież zewnętrzna z membraną Vaportex ochroni przed deszczem, śniegiem oraz wiatrem. Parametry każdego z poziomów Vaportex’u oznaczają, iż podczas wzmożonego wysiłku nadmiar wilgoci wytworzo","tokens":["S","zer","oki"," wybór"," metod"," pł","at","ności","\n","W"," nas","zym"," sk","le","pie"," ak","cept","ujemy"," pł","at","ności"," realiz","owane"," przy"," pom","ocy"," SO","F","ORT"," Banking",","," Pay","U",","," PayPal",","," rat","y"," Sy","g","ma"," Bank",","," Pr","ze","lew"," na"," k","onto",","," Bon"," to","war","owy",","," Bon"," od"," wp",".pl","."," Ist","nie","je"," również"," możliwość"," pł","at","ności"," przy"," o","db","ior","ze","."," P","łat","ności"," można"," dok","ony","wać"," przez"," kil","ka"," różnych"," form"," dzi","el","ąc"," cał","k","ow","it","ą"," kw","ot","ę"," na"," kw","ot","y"," cz","ą","stk","owe"," i"," dok","on","ując"," pł","at","ności"," jed","na"," po"," drug","iej"," każd","or","az","owo"," okre","śl","ając"," prefer","owan","ą"," form","ę",".\n","D","ost","awy","\n","W"," nas","zym"," sk","le","pie"," mas","z"," du","ży"," wybór"," spos","ob","u"," dost","awy"," to","war","u","."," Pro","pon","ujemy"," pac","z","kom","aty"," In","Post",","," Fed","ex"," Pols","ka",","," UPS"," standard",","," D","PD","."," C","zas"," dost","awy"," w"," przypad","ku"," kur","iera"," to"," ","2","4"," god","z","iny"," od"," czas","u"," nad","ania"," prz","esy","ł","ki","."," Wi","ę","cej"," inform","acji"," dostęp","nych"," jest"," na"," stron","ie"," z"," kos","zt","ami"," wys","y","ł","ki",".\n","Inform","acje"," dod","atk","owe","\n","K","ont","akt"," tele","f","onic","z","ny"," z"," obs","ług","ą"," sk","le","pu"," jest"," możli","wy"," od"," pon","ied","ział","ku"," do"," pi","ą","tk","u"," w"," god","zin","ach"," od"," ","8",":","0","0"," do"," ","1","8",":","0","0",","," w"," sob","ot","y"," od"," ","8",":","0","0"," do"," ","1","4",":","0","0","."," D","ział"," rekl","amac","ji"," prac","uje