d, in careful and rather dry prose, that dichlorodiphenyltrichloroethane should be restricted to a small set of uses. He noted that the compound did not break down quickly in soil, that it moved into the tissue of animals that fed on treated ground, and that the birds at the top of the food chain carried the highest loads. The committee read the letter twice and asked for more data. A further year passed. Other letters arrived, some of them angry, most of them polite, and a few of them from people who had never seen the marshes and who wrote only to say that the matter had been settled long ago. By the autumn of the third year the panel had produced a draft. It recommended a limited ban, careful monitoring, and a review of the remaining permits at the end of five years. The draft said nothing about the chemist, who had by then retired, and very little about the birds.","passed":false,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.318415,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"A regulatory long-context holdout from a genre absent from the examples, with a twelve-piece technical word (' dich'...'eth'+'ane') deep in the passage where the attribution says distant context matters.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"Historians still debate how antidisestablishmentarianism shaped the church politics of the eighteen thirties.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":2.143534,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"A paraphrase holdout in church history whose six-piece word puts 'arian' immediately before the final piece, exactly the position the hypothesis predicts should fire.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"She spoke uncharacteristically softly at the family dinner, and nobody mentioned the argument in the kitchen.","passed":false,"expected_active":true,"activation":0.709746,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"An everyday domestic genre whose adverb splits into three pieces ('un'+'ch